    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 46,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 2,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## CO-26 Per-farm cost\nThe per-farm, per-trip and per-campaign cost is the usage allocation of the landing zone (section 5.3, ASM-065), computed monthly from the CUR 2.0 export and the usage counts of the platform stores. Cost Anomaly Detection alerts and budget alerts arrive on the budget topic of the landing zone, not on this dashboard."
      }
